                      (    forth6809.asm):02957         
E2F3 BDDFE1           (    forth6809.asm):02958         DOEXEC:     JSR   EXECUTEW
E2F6 20D7             (    forth6809.asm):02959                     BRA   ILOOP
                      (    forth6809.asm):02960         
E2F8 BDE4CA           (    forth6809.asm):02961         TRYNUM:     JSR   NUMBERQ
E2FB 3706             (    forth6809.asm):02962                     PULU  D
